 worm chill aura and Worm Trill, and his Freezing Blood affects random enemies instead of random creatures. His Death Throes, however, still affect all creatures and objects in a 100-foot burst.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!TIKRIsNrM5sh9sfs.mgcqbavvs7zqbssl"},{"_id":"il23b5i9309s8T7B","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Worm Chill","sort":400000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>5 feet. A creature that enters or begins its turn in the emanation takes @Damage[3d6[cold]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:29|basic|options:area-effect]).</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[{"key":"Aura","radius":5,"slug":"worm-chill","traits":["cold","primal"]}],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["aura","cold","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!TIKRIsNrM5sh9sfs.il23b5i9309s8T7B"},{"_id":"2MjViUo49YMMxENY","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Worm Trill","sort":500000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>The frost worm emits a hypnotic trill. Each non-frost worm creature within 100 feet must attempt a @Check[will|dc:32] save. The effects of Worm Trill last for 1 round, but if the frost worm uses this ability again on subsequent rounds, it extends this duration by 1 round for any creature already affected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected and is immune to Worm Trill for 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AdPVz7rbaVSRxHFg]{Fascinated} by the frost worm.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the fascinated condition doesn't end if the frost worm uses hostile actions against the creature.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["auditory","concentrate","mental","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!TIKRIsNrM5sh9sfs.2MjViUo49YMMxENY"},{"_id":"AMTVY6uDQ8Mh0jdq","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Breath Weapon","sort":600000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The frost worm exhales a blast of frost, dealing @Damage[13d6[cold]|options:area-damage] damage to creatures in a @Template[cone|distance:50] (@Check[reflex|dc:32|basic|options:area-effect] save).</p>\n<p>It can't use Breath Weapon again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Breath Weapon]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["cold","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!TIKRIsNrM5sh9sfs.AMTVY6uDQ8Mh0jdq"},{"_id":"doPySREesBUunu15","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp","name":"Freezing Blood","sort":700000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The frost worm takes piercing or slashing damage</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The fros